#. i18n: file: src/lib/MarbleNavigationSettingsWidget.ui:114
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_animateTargetVoyage)
#: rc.cpp:624
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
